Effective date: April 21, 2026

Idle (“we,” “our,” or “us”) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you use the Idle app.

## Information We Collect

We may collect the following types of information:

### Account Information
- Name
- Email address
- Username
- Profile details you choose to provide

### User Content
- Profile information
- Photos and media you upload
- Messages and other content you create or share in the app
- Meet, group, or event-related content
- Preferences and settings you choose to save

### Device and Technical Information
- Device type
- Operating system
- App version
- IP address
- Diagnostic and crash data
- Basic usage data needed to operate and improve the app

## How We Use Information

We may use information to:
- Provide, maintain, and improve Idle
- Create and manage user accounts
- Support social, meet, group, and messaging features
- Respond to support requests
- Monitor performance, fix bugs, and improve reliability
- Protect the security, safety, and integrity of the app
- Comply with legal obligations

## Sharing of Information

We do not sell your personal information.

We may share information only when necessary to:
- Operate and maintain the app and its services
- Work with service providers that help support app functionality
- Comply with legal requests or obligations
- Protect the rights, safety, and security of our users or the service

## Data Retention

We retain information only for as long as needed to provide the app, meet legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.

## Your Choices

You may be able to update or remove certain account information within the app.  
If you need help with account access, data questions, or deletion requests, contact us at **idle@engineer.com**.

## Children’s Privacy

Idle is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. If we make material changes, we will update this page with the new effective date.

## Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or need support, contact:

**idle@engineer.com**
